[{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0908","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0908.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-17621","title":"D-Link DIR-859 路由器 UPnP 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"D-Link DIR-859 无线路由器固件版本 1.05 及 1.06B01 Beta01 的 UPnP 服务中存在操作系统命令注入漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可在连接到本地网络后，向 UPnP 服务的 /gena.cgi 端点发送特制的 HTTP SUBSCRIBE 请求，从而以 root 权限在目标设备上执行任意系统命令。攻击者利用该漏洞可完全控制路由器，进而窃取网络流量、发起中间人攻击或将设备纳入僵尸网络。CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。D-Link 已发布固件更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-17621"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-12-30T17:15:19Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:24:17Z","remediation":"立即将 DIR-859 固件升级至 v1.07b03_beta 或更高版本。升级需分两步：先通过设备 Web 管理界面刷入中间固件 DIR859_FW107b02beta01_20190125_j1o9_middle.bin，再刷入最终固件 DIR859_FW107b03_jbli_beta.bin。如设备已停止支持无法获取补丁，建议立即停用该设备并更换为受支持的新型号，同时在防火墙层面限制对 UPnP 服务（端口 1900/5000）的 LAN 侧访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156054/D-Link-DIR-859-Unauthenticated-Remote-Command-Execution.html","https://medium.com/%40s1kr10s/d-link-dir-859-rce-unautenticated-cve-2019-17621-en-d94b47a15104","https://medium.com/%40s1kr10s/d-link-dir-859-rce-unautenticated-cve-2019-17621-es-fad716629ff9","https://supportannouncement.us.dlink.com/announcement/publication.aspx?name=SAP10146","https://supportannouncement.us.dlink.com/announcement/publication.aspx?name=SAP10147","https://www.dlink.com/en/security-bulletin","https://www.ftc.gov/system/files/documents/cases/dlink_proposed_order_and_judgment_7-2-19.pdf","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-17621","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-17621.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2019/CVE-2019-17621.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2019/17xxx/CVE-2019-17621.json","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/IoT-vulhub/blob/80a58b00485403fd88578da85d846210cc9792f2/D-Link/CVE-2019-17621/README.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2019/17xxx/CVE-2019-17621.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/74a17114d313d1fcf11590910ec4d27e95394ac2/2019/CVE-2019-17621.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-17621.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-17621.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-17621.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-17621.json","https://github.com/s1kr10s/D-Link-DIR-859-RCE","https://github.com/Squirre17/CVE-2019-17621"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0908.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0906","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0906.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-17558","title":"Apache Solr Velocity 模板注入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apache Solr 5.0.0 至 8.3.1 版本中的 VelocityResponseWriter 存在远程代码执行漏洞。攻击者可通过 Velocity 模板注入，在 configset 的 velocity/ 目录中放置恶意模板，或通过参数传入恶意模板代码。当管理员在响应写入器配置中启用 params.resource.loader.enabled 设置后，具有配置 API 访问权限的远程攻击者即可通过发送特制请求执行任意系统命令。该漏洞利用后可直接获取服务器控制权，导致敏感数据泄露及系统被完全接管，危害等级严重。Apache 已在 Solr 8.4 版本中移除了 params 资源加载器并修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-17558"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-12-30T17:15:19Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:24:09Z","remediation":"建议将受影响的软件升级到厂商发布的最新安全版本，或根据官方安全公告应用相应的安全补丁。如暂无补丁，建议采取临时缓解措施限制攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157078/Apache-Solr-8.3.0-Velocity-Template-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/SOLR-13971","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r0b7b9d4113e6ec1ae1d3d0898