00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157196/TVT-NVMS-1000-Directory-Traversal.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47774","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-20085","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48311","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-20085.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-20085.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2019/CVE-2019-20085.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2019-20085.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-20085-4072.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-20085-4074.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-20085-4069.yaml","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/TVT_数码科技_NVMS-1000_路径遍历漏洞（CVE-2019-20085）___孤桜懶契.md","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/TVT NVMS-1000/CVE-2019-20085.yaml","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/b51e2278437c32dc795d5eaa3888baba6465f89d/data/by-cve/CVE-2019-20085.md","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2019-20085.js","https://github.com/AleDiBen/NVMS1000-Exploit","https://github.com/Z3R0space/CVE-2019-20085","https://github.com/0hmsec/NVMS-1000-Directory-Traversal-Bash"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1106.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1100","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-19781","title":"Citrix ADC 和 Gateway 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Citrix ADC 与 Gateway 存在目录遍历漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备的 /vpns/ 目录发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用路径遍历绕过权限检查，将恶意文件写入服务器任意目录，进而触发 Perl 脚本解析实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Citrix ADC 和 Gateway 10.5、11.1、12.0、12.1 及 13.0 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击无需认证，利用复杂度低，已出现大量在野利用和 Metasploit 模块，CISA 已将其列入已知被利用漏洞目录。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-19781"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-12-27T14:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:27:14Z","remediation":"立即升级 Citrix ADC/Gateway 至以下安全版本：ADC 12.1 build 55.18 及以上、ADC 13.0 build 47.24 及以上、ADC 11.1 build 63.9 及以上。如无法立即升级，可在 Citrix ADC 管理界面中禁用 HTTP 到 HTTPS 的重定向功能，并在 NetScaler 上配置响应式规则阻止对 `/vpns/` 目录的异常访问请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155904/Citrix-Application-Delivery-Controller-Gateway-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155905/Citrix-Application-Delivery-Controller-Gateway-Remote-Code-Execution-Traversal.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155930/Citrix-Application-Delivery-Controller-Gateway-10.5-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155947/Citrix-ADC-NetScaler-Directory-Traversal-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155972/Citrix-ADC-Gateway-Path-Traversal.html","https://badpackets.net/over-25000-citrix-netscaler-endpoints-vulnerable-to-cve-2019-19781/","https://forms.gle/eDf3DXZAv96oosfj6","https://support.citrix.com/article/CTX267027","https://twitter.com/bad_packets/status/1215431625766424576","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/619785","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-19781","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47913","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-19781.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-19781.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2019/CVE-2019-19781.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/网络设备漏洞/Citrix 远程命令执行漏洞 CVE-2019-19781.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/network/citrix/CVE-2019-19781.md","https://github.com/trustedsec/cve-2019-19781/blob/18775c69d487cfacd7ca8022b6d40bac5aac4c7d/cve-2019-19781_scanner.py","https://github.com/r1cksec/cheatsheets/blob/d5cc6d24474592639d45560098a2ad4d1aacf089/exploit/CVE-2019-19781.md","https://github.com/projectzeroindia/CVE-2019-19781/blob/cf7289d77f25fbeb8edaf5ebad34e37c89df7b83/CVE-2019-19781.sh","https://github.com/jiushill/note/blob/95d7b730981c6562e119d037ce00d6131c8de95d/自己写的工具/Citrix_exp/CVE-2019-19781.py","https://github.com/gobysec/GobyVuls/blob/a5de8e3be10d51a94e0977ecd8086c176251229f/Citrix/CVE-2019-19781/README.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/b51e2278437c32dc795d5eaa3888baba6465f89d/data/by-cve/CVE-2019-19781.md","https://github.com/trustedsec/cve-2019-19781","https://github.com/projectzeroindia/CVE-2019-19781","https://github.com/mpgn/CVE-2019-19781","https://github.com/MalwareTech/CitrixHoneypot","https://github.com/cisagov/check-cve-2019-19781"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0168","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0168.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-10758","title":"mongo-express 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"mongo-express 0.54.0 之前版本中存在远程代码执行漏洞，漏洞位于 lib/bson.js 的 toBSON() 函数中，/checkValid 路由从外部接收输入并调用该函数，由于对 vm 依赖的不安全使用，攻击者可通过构造恶意 document 参数执行任意 Node.js 代码。攻击者需拥有有效凭据（默认账号密码 admin:pass）或已通过身份认证，在成功登录后即可利用该漏洞在目标服务器上执行任意命令，完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响 mongo-express 所有低于 0.54.0 的版本，CVSS 评分 9.9，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.9,"aliases":["CVE-2019-10758"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-12-24T22:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:11:36Z","remediation":"立即将 mongo-express 升级至 0.54.0 或更高版本：通过 npm 执行 `npm install mongo-express@0.54.0`，或在 package.json 中将依赖版本更新为 ^0.54.0 后执行 `npm update mongo-express`，然后重启服务使其生效；0.54.0 版本修复了 toBSON 方法在非安全环境下执行 exec 命令的问题。如无法立即升级，可采取以下缓解措施：1) 修改默认账号密码 admin:pass，通过环境变量 ME_CONFIG_BASICAUTH_USERNAME/ME_CONFIG_BASICAUTH_PASSWORD 配置强身份认证；2) 将服务仅绑定至内网或可信网段，禁止将 8081 管理端口暴露于公网；3) 在防火墙或安全组中限制仅允许可信来源 IP 访问该端口。该漏洞已列入 CISA KEV 目录，存在在野利用，应优先尽快修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://snyk.io/vuln/SNYK-JS-MONGOEXPRESS-473215","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-10758","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-10758.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2019/CVE-2019-10758.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/Web应用漏洞/mongo-express 远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2019-10758.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/mongo-express/CVE-2019-10758.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-10758/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2019-10758.py","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/webapp/mongo-express-远程代码执行漏洞-CVE-2019-10758.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2019/CVE-2019-10758.py","https://github.com/gobysec/GobyVuls/blob/a5de8e3be10d51a94e0977ecd8086c176251229f/Mongo-Express/CVE-2019-10758/README.md","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2019/CVE-2019-10758.yaml","https://github.com/Ares-X/VulWiki/blob/40e0273754a36f49a6be6a77a7a4c210a07063ed/Web安全/Mongo express/（CVE-2019-10758）Mongo expres rce.md","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2019-10758.yaml","https://github.com/masahiro331/CVE-2019-10758","https://github.com/lp008/CVE-2019-10758","https://github.com/ossf-cve-benchmark/CVE-2019-10758"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0168.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0168.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0168.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0020","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0020.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-7483","title":"SonicWall SMA100 路径遍历漏洞","description":"SonicWall SMA100 设备中存在路径遍历漏洞，位于 handleWAFRedirect CGI 处理程序中。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用目录遍历技术读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 SMA100 系列设备，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。SonicWall 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议用户及时升级至最新版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-7483"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-12-19T01:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:40:39Z","remediation":"立即将 SonicWall SMA100 固件升级至 9.0.0.4 或更高版本（对应安全公告 SNWLID-2019-0018）。如无法立即升级，可在管理界面禁用 handleWAFRedirect CGI 功能，并在防火墙上限制对 SMA100 管理端口的非信任来源访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://psirt.global.sonicwall.com/vuln-detail/SNWLID-2019-0018","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-7483","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-7483.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2019/7xxx/CVE-2019-7483.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2019/7xxx/CVE-2019-7483.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-7483.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-7483.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-7483.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-7483.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-7483.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2019-7483.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2019/CVE-2019-74xx/CVE-2019-7483.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0020.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1681","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1681.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-8605","title":"Apple macOS/iOS XNU 内核释放后使用漏洞","description":"CVE-2019-8605 是 Apple XNU 内核中 `in6_pcbdetach` 函数存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。当处理 IPv6 套接字拆卸流程时，由于对已释放的指针对象未正确清理，导致悬垂指针被再次引用。本地攻击者可通过运行特制应用程序触发该漏洞，利用悬垂指针实现内核态内存破坏，进而提升至 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 macOS 10.14.5 之前版本及 iOS 12.3 之前版本，已有公开利用代码（ExploitDB 46892），Apple 在 HT210118 安全公告中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2019-8605"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-12-19T00:00:00Z","updated":"2019-12-19T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 macOS 升级至 10.14.5 或更高版本（High Sierra/Sierra 用户安装 Security Update 2019-003），将 iOS 升级至 12.3 或更高版本。该漏洞位于 XNU 内核 IPv6 协议栈的 in6_pcbdetach 函数中，无有效临时缓解措施，必须通过系统更新彻底修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46892","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-8605","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-8605.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c908bbff86d2944f8f8a39e75f549a966c642420/2019/CVE-2019-8605.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6ff73fb4bb99974a2b535c179f337dd820550366/2019/8xxx/CVE-2019-8605.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-8605.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-8605.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-8605.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-8605.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/db09292fb11e6e85f066b9d4f61163327f785736/CVEs/2019/CVE-2019-8605.md","https://github.com/BrokenPorkMachine/B34ST/blob/f4b5602a1ba3cb1d1cc6f89afe06462855e57582/exploits/kernel/CVE-2019-8605.c","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c908bbff86d2944f8f8a39e75f549a966c642420/2019/CVE-2019-8591.json","https://github.com/jsherman212/used_sock","https://github.com/1nteger-c/CVE-2019-8605"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-1681.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1681.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0021","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0021.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-8526","title":"Apple macOS Mojave 释放后使用权限提升漏洞","description":"Apple macOS Mojave 中存在一处释放后使用（Use-After-Free）内存破坏漏洞，该漏洞源于对内存对象生命周期管理不当。本地攻击者可通过运行特制的应用程序触发已释放内存的访问，从而利用该漏洞实现权限提升，获取系统最高控制权。攻击者需具备本地用户权限，无需用户交互即可利用。该漏洞影响 macOS Mojave 10.14.4 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-8526"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-12-18T18:15:24Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:42:06Z","remediation":"升级至 macOS Mojave 10.14.4 或更高版本，通过系统偏好设置 → 软件更新完成安装。如无法立即升级，可限制非授权用户本地登录权限，并监控异常提权行为作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.apple.com/HT209600","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-8526","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-8526.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2019/8xxx/CVE-2019-8526.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2019/8xxx/CVE-2019-8526.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-8526.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-8526.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-8526.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-8526.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-8526.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2019-8526.json","https://github.com/rmusser01/Infosec_Reference/blob/af8b68e2194e695c542eb76fba762d2f0a19a0dc/Draft/PrivescPostExmac.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0021.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1680","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1680.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-8506","title":"Apple iTunes for Windows WebKit 类型混淆远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple iTunes for Windows 中的 WebKit 组件存在类型混淆（Type Confusion）漏洞，CWE-843。该漏洞源于 JavaScriptCore 引擎的 `createRegExpMatchesArray` 函数在处理特制网页内容时未能正确验证对象类型，导致内存处理不当。远程攻击者可诱导用户访问恶意构造的网页，触发类型混淆，从而在当前进程上下文中实现任意代码执行。受影响的版本包括 iTunes for Windows 12.9.3 及更早版本、iOS 12.2 之前版本、Safari 12.1 之前版本等。攻击需要用户交互（如点击恶意链接），但无需身份认证，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Apple 已在 iOS 12.2、tvOS 12.2、watchOS 5.2、Safari 12.1、iTunes 12.9.4 for Windows 及 iCloud for Windows 7.11 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-8506"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-12-18T18:15:22Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:42:03Z","remediation":"升级 iTunes for Windows 至 12.9.4 或更高版本，升级 iCloud for Windows 至 7.11 或更高版本，升级 Safari 至 12.1 或更高版本。iOS 设备升级至 12.2 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可禁用 WebKit 解析不可信网页内容作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.apple.com/HT209599","https://support.apple.com/HT209601","https://support.apple.com/HT209602","https://support.apple.com/HT209603","https://support.apple.com/HT209604","https://support.apple.com/HT209605","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-8506","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46647","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-8506.md","https://github.com/tunz/js-vuln-db/blob/26d3f06008cbf95d05f066d2bf2a220deff491fc/jsc/CVE-2019-8506.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2019/8xxx/CVE-2019-8506.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-8506.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-8506.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-8506.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/active/CVE-2019-8506","https://github.com/tunz/js-vuln-db/blob/26d3f06008cbf95d05f066d2bf2a220deff491fc/README.md","https://github.com/Simpsonpt/AppSecEzine/blob/5f446fcfcccf21c49b6f4258aeb7ced58439d410/Ezines/275 - AppSec Ezine","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-8506.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1680.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1606","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1606.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-7287","title":"Apple iOS 内核内存损坏任意代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple iOS 内核 IOKit 驱动中的 ProvInfoIOKitUserClient 用户客户端存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞位于 ucEncryptSUInfo 外部方法中，攻击者可控的 struct_in 缓冲区偏移 0x7d4 处的值被直接作为 memmove 函数的大小参数使用，未经任何边界检查，导致内核堆内存越界写入。本地攻击者可通过诱导用户打开恶意应用程序触发该漏洞，实现以内核权限执行任意代码，完全控制目标设备。该漏洞影响 iOS 10 至 12.1.3 版本，已在 iOS 12.1.4 中修复。此漏洞由 Google 威胁分析小组（TAG）和 Project Zero 团队在野外攻击链中发现并报告，已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），属于在野活跃利用的 0-day 漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-7287"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-12-18T18:15:22Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:40:23Z","remediation":"立即将 iOS 升级至 12.1.4 或更高版本（适用于 iPhone 5s 及更新机型、iPad Air 及更新机型、iPod touch 第 6 代）。该版本修复了 IOKit 内核内存损坏漏洞。如无法立即升级，建议限制不可信应用安装权限，并启用 MDM 策略强制推送安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.apple.com/HT209520","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-7287","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-7287.md","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2019/CVE-2019-7287.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2019/7xxx/CVE-2019-7287.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2019/7xxx/CVE-2019-7287.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-7287.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-7287.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-7287.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-7287.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2019-7287.json","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2019/CVE-2019-7286.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1606.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1600","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1600.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-7286","title":"Apple iOS 和 macOS cfprefsd 内存损坏权限提升漏洞","description":"iOS 和 macOS 系统中的 cfprefsd 组件存在内存损坏漏洞（CWE-787 越界写入），由于对输入验证不足导致。本地攻击者可通过诱使用户打开恶意应用程序触发该漏洞，成功利用可在目标系统上以内核权限执行任意代码，实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 iOS 12.1.4 之前版本及 macOS Mojave 10.14.3 补充更新之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Apple 已在 2019 年 2 月发布的安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-7286"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-12-18T18:15:22Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:40:23Z","remediation":"立即将 iPhone/iPad 升级至 iOS 12.1.4 或更高版本（设置 > 通用 > 软件更新），将 Mac 升级至 macOS Mojave 10.14.3 Supplemental Update（系统偏好设置 > 软件更新）。该漏洞已被 Google Project Zero 发现并确认存在在野利用，无法立即升级时建议限制不可信应用的安装与运行，并启用系统完整性保护（SIP）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.apple.com/HT209520","https://support.apple.com/HT209521","https://support.apple.com/HT209601","https://support.apple.com/HT209602","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-7286","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46803","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-7286.md","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2019/CVE-2019-7286.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2019/7xxx/CVE-2019-7286.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2019/7xxx/CVE-2019-7286.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-7286.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-7286.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-7286.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-7286.json","https://github.com/Simpsonpt/AppSecEzine/blob/5f446fcfcccf21c49b6f4258aeb7ced58439d410/Ezines/267 - AppSec Ezine","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-7286.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1600.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1300","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-4716","title":"IBM Planning Analytics 未认证远程代码执行漏洞","description":"IBM Planning Analytics 2.0.0 至 2.0.8 版本存在配置覆盖漏洞，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过特制请求覆盖管理员配置，以 \"admin\" 用户身份登录系统，进而利用 TM1 脚本功能以 root 或 SYSTEM 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 IBM Planning Analytics 2.0.0-2.0.8 所有版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 9.8（严重），攻击向量为网络远程、攻击复杂度低、无需权限与用户交互。攻击者仅需向目标服务发送恶意配置请求即可触发，成功利用可导致服务器完全沦陷。IBM 已发布安全补丁修复此漏洞，建议尽快升级至 2.0.9 或更高版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-4716"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-12-18T17:16:43Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:36:50Z","remediation":"立即升级到 IBM Planning Analytics 2.0.9 及以上版本，这是根本解决方法。升级前，可临时通过修改防火墙规则禁止访问 TM1 管理端口 5498/5495的非管理流量，或将 Admin 服务器从互联网直接暴露移除至内部网络作为紧急缓解措施。若无法立即升级，建议禁用所有未使用的服务和端口，并限制admin账户仅本地登录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156953/IBM-Cognos-TM1-IBM-Planning-Analytics-Server-Configuration-Overwrite-Code-Execution.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2020/Mar/44","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/172094","https://www.ibm.com/support/pages/node/1127781","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-4716","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48273","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-4716.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-4716.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2019/CVE-2019-4716.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0812ebe932b97710173c59d3d74959fb420956eb/2019/4xxx/CVE-2019-4716.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/96acb02a8d6942d7cdf496f8d887cd0035972f4b/data/by-cve/CVE-2019-4716.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/f793cabbd56af386bba619c0dff897c8d6cbc1f2/2019/CVE-2019-4716.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/dce139c84c439e9fc87d0eb2079ddda89aaeb75c/plugins/ibm/planning_analytics/CVE-2019-4716.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-4716.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-4716.md","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-4716.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-4716.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-1300.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-1300.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1300.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1608","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1608.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-7481","title":"SonicWall SMA100 SQL注入漏洞","description":"SonicWall SMA100 设备存在 SQL 注入漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用输入验证缺陷注入恶意 SQL 语句，从而绕过认证机制获取对未授权资源的只读访问权限。该漏洞影响 SMA100 系列设备 9.0.0.3 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。SonicWall 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-7481"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-12-17T23:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:40:38Z","remediation":"立即将 SonicWall SRA 4600 等旧款设备升级替换为受支持的 SMA 100 系列硬件，并安装 SMA 100 10.x 固件最新版本。在完成硬件替换前，启用多因素认证（MFA）作为临时缓解措施，同时在 VPN 日志中监控 \"Virtual Assist Installing Customer App\" 和 \"python-requests\" 等可疑字符串，发现异常立即阻断来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://psirt.global.sonicwall.com/vuln-detail/SNWLID-2019-0016","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-7481","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-7481.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-7481.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2019-7481.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-7481-4230.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-7481-4226.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2019/7xxx/CVE-2019-7481.json","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2019-7481.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-7481/poc/nuclei/CVE-2019-7481.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-7481.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-7481.md","https://github.com/u21h2/nacs/blob/1eaa239ded7496317a47073605c8ddda70686ef5/web/poc/pocs/nuclei/cves/2019/CVE-2019-7481.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-1608.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-1608.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1608.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1000","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1000.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-18935","title":"Progress Telerik UI for ASP.NET AJAX 反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Progress Telerik UI for ASP.NET AJAX 的 RadAsyncUpload 组件存在 .NET 反序列化漏洞。攻击者需先利用 CVE-2017-11317 或 CVE-2017-11357 获取加密密钥，随后构造特制请求触发不安全反序列化，可在目标服务器上以应用权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 2019.3.1023 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。2020.1.114 版本已通过默认安全配置修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-18935"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-12-11T13:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:25:36Z","remediation":"立即升级 Telerik UI for ASP.NET AJAX 至 2020.1.114 或更高版本，该版本默认启用安全配置阻止反序列化攻击。如无法升级，在 2019.3.1023 中手动设置 RadAsyncUpload 的 `AsyncUploadConfigurationEncryption` 为 `true` 并更换加密密钥；同时修复 CVE-2017-11317 和 CVE-2017-11357 防止密钥泄露。在 Web.config 中禁用 `Telerik.AsyncUpload.ConfigurationEncryptionKey` 的硬编码密钥作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155720/Telerik-UI-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/159653/Telerik-UI-ASP.NET-AJAX-RadAsyncUpload-Deserialization.html","https://codewhitesec.blogspot.com/2019/02/telerik-revisited.html","https://github.com/bao7uo/RAU_crypto","https://github.com/noperator/CVE-2019-18935","https://know.bishopfox.com/research/cve-2019-18935-remote-code-execution-in-telerik-ui","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/us-federal-agency-hacked-using-old-telerik-bug-to-steal-data/","https://www.telerik.com/support/kb/aspnet-ajax/details/allows-javascriptserializer-deserialization","https://www.telerik.com/support/whats-new/aspnet-ajax/release-history/ui-for-asp-net-ajax-r1-2020-%28version-2020-1-114%29","https://www.telerik.com/support/whats-new/release-history","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-18935","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47793","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-18935.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2019/CVE-2019-18935.md","https://github.com/noperator/CVE-2019-18935/blob/7701b27f238b888bfa7168ea4fbe5a3b9550b110/CVE-2019-18935.py","https://github.com/crowdsecurity/hub/blob/9e987ce9652feb07217e72ab766842bc305285c8/scenarios/crowdsecurity/CVE-2019-18935.md","https://github.com/gobysec/GobyVuls/blob/a5de8e3be10d51a94e0977ecd8086c176251229f/Telerik-UI/CVE-2019-18935/REMAD.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/b51e2278437c32dc795d5eaa3888baba6465f89d/data/by-cve/CVE-2019-18935.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2017/CVE-2017-11357.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2017/CVE-2017-11317.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/74a17114d313d1fcf11590910ec4d27e95394ac2/2019/CVE-2019-18935.json","https://github.com/PaoloFrigo/scriptinglibrary/blob/1c584b5339ef6547debc2755d479969376fe0a57/Blog/PowerShell/Check-CVE-2019-18935.ps1","https://github.com/murataydemir/CVE-2019-18935","https://github.com/ThanHuuTuan/Telerik_CVE-2019-18935","https://github.com/dust-life/CVE-2019-18935-memShell"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1000.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0608","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0608.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-1458","title":"Microsoft Windows Win32k 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows Win32k 组件在内存中处理对象时存在释放后使用漏洞，已获得低权限的本地攻击者可通过在目标系统上运行特制的恶意应用程序触发该漏洞，利用 Win32k 内核模式驱动对内核对象的错误引用实现权限提升，从而获取 SYSTEM 权限并完全控制系统。该漏洞影响 Windows 7/8.1/10 及 Windows Server 2008/2012/2016/2019 等多个版本，已有公开的利用工具（代号 WizardOpium）和 PoC 代码，Google Project Zero 也发布了详细分析报告。Microsoft 已在 2019 年 12 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1458"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-12-10T22:15:16Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:28:38Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2019 年 12 月安全更新（Windows 10 对应 KB4530681/KB4530684，Windows 7 对应 KB4530692，Windows 8.1 对应 KB4530702，Windows Server 对应 KB4530691/KGB4530714 等），或通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新。如无法立即打补丁，可限制低权限用户登录系统作为临时缓解措施，同时监控异常的系统调用行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156651/Microsoft-Windows-WizardOpium-Local-Privilege-Escalation.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/159569/Microsoft-Windows-Uninitialized-Variable-Local-Privilege-Escalation.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-1458","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-1458","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48180","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1458.md","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2019/CVE-2019-1458.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2019-1458/README.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2019-1458/README_EN.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2019-1458/cve-2019-1458/Source.cpp","https://github.com/SecWiki/windows-kernel-exploits/blob/2b944b52ee30f8833a21f0805d2627ca1f15383a/README.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-1458.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-1458.md","https://github.com/Ares-X/VulWiki/blob/40e0273754a36f49a6be6a77a7a4c210a07063ed/系统安全/Windows/Windows本地提权漏洞/（CVE-2019-1458）Win32k本地提权.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-1458.json","https://github.com/piotrflorczyk/cve-2019-1458_POC","https://github.com/rip1s/CVE-2019-1458","https://github.com/Eternit7/CVE-2019-1458"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0608.toml"}]